      "solution": "Area=1/2 x base x height => 3+sqrt5 = 1/2 x (sqrt5-1) x h => h = 2(3+sqrt5)/(sqrt5-1). Rationalise: 2(3+sqrt5)(sqrt5+1)/(5-1)=2(3sqrt5+3+5+sqrt5)/4=2(8+4sqrt5)/4=4+2sqrt5 => h=4+2sqrt5... Wait compute: 2(3+sqrt5)(sqrt5+1)/4 = (3+sqrt5)(sqrt5+1)/2 = (3sqrt5+3+5+sqrt5)/2=(4sqrt5+8)/2=2sqrt5+4",
